invalid type: string "3. Enter your Aadhaar number and verify with the OTP sent to your mobile\n4. Fill in personal details such as name, father's name, mobile number, address\n5. Enter your land details including survey number, extent, village, mandal, \ndistrict\n6. Upload scanned copies of Aadhaar, bank passbook, and land document\n7. Link your Aadhaar with your bank account (NPCI mapping)\nÿÿÿ